://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260320/202603202333395011.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260320/202603202333395011.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">据《马卡报》统计，皇马本赛季已经遭遇了51起伤病，仅5人没受过伤。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-20/69bd6ae6f0fe3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：加维再次重伤后曾遭遇心理障碍，担心又受伤无法找回状态</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b900bc805e4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b900bc805e4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b900bc805e4.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">记者哈维·坎波斯在播客节目Barça Reservat中透露，这次半月板伤病给加维带来更多烦恼、痛苦和焦虑。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-21/69bd6cb690844native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：门将雨果·索萨入选巴西国家队，替代受伤的阿利松</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220517/62835ff242a62.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; he